{"path": "notebook/papers/gmpo.md", "updated": "2026-10-19T16:22:20+08:00", "url": "https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/942d9d11e90b4475f3fff062103b3a042e36f288/notebook/papers/gmpo.md", "html": "<h1 id=\"gmpo-geometric-mean-policy-optimization\">GMPO: Geometric-Mean Policy Optimization（论文精读）</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.20673\">arXiv:2507.20673</a> · Yuzhong Zhao et al. · 2025-07\n精读时间：2026-10-19 · 关联：<a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/942d9d11e90b4475f3fff062103b3a042e36f288/notebook/papers/rl-policy-loss-functions-mathematical-derivation.md\">RL 损失函数推导</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/942d9d11e90b4475f3fff062103b3a042e36f288/notebook/papers/grpo-training-algorithm-unified-synthesis.md\">GRPO 综合</a>\n动机：verl #7913 geo_mean 损失修复（candidate-7913）需对照论文验证实现语义。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">一句话</h2>\n<p>GRPO 对 token 级奖励求<strong>算术</strong>平均，遇离群 importance ratio 时更新不稳；GMPO 改求<strong>几何</strong>平均，同一序列内 outlier ratio 被几何均值吸收，权重更稳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eq-4\">目标函数（Eq. 4）</h2>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><